++## ❌ Critical Issue Identified
++
++### The Problem: Field Loss in Normalization
++
++The `ClassicEffectiveInputs` type only has **6 fields**:
++```typescript
++export interface ClassicEffectiveInputs {
++  weightLb: number;
++  powerHP_effective: number;
++  tireDiaIn_effective: number;
++  rearGear_effective: number;
++  rolloutIn_effective: number | null;
++  engineCurve?: Array<{ rpm: number; hp: number; tq?: number }>;
++  finishDistFt_effective: number;
++}
++```
++
++**All other fields are lost** during normalization:
++- ❌ transmissionGearing[] (3 gears with ratios/efficiencies/shiftRpm)
++- ❌ frontalArea_ft2, dragCoeff, liftCoeff
++- ❌ drivetrainEfficiency
++- ❌ stallRpm, slipRpm, clutchSlippage
++- ❌ engineFlywheelClutchPMI, transmissionDriveshaftPMI, tiresWheelsRingGearPMI
++- ❌ wheelbaseIn, overhangIn, tireWidthIn
++- ❌ elevation, barometerInHg, temperatureF, humidityPct, tractionIndex
++- ❌ windVelocityMph, windAngleDeg, trackTempF
++
++### Impact on Simulation
++
++**QuarterJrTest1 Results:**
++- ❌ 103 mismatches out of 25 checks
++- RPM: 24 mismatches, avg Δ=**664 rpm**, max Δ=**2000 rpm**
++- Time: 24 mismatches, avg Δ=**4.3s**, max Δ=**6.6s**
++- MPH: 24 mismatches, avg Δ=**19.2 mph**, max Δ=**21.8 mph**
++- Gear: 19 mismatches (sim stuck in gear 1, JSON shows 3-speed shifting)
++
++**Debug Snapshot Shows:**
++```json
++{
++  "weightLb": 3600,
++  "powerHP_effective": 325,
++  "tireDiaIn_effective": 28,
++  "rearGear_effective": 4.11,
++  "rolloutIn_effective": 14,
++  "finishDistFt_effective": 1320
++}
++```
++
++**Missing from normalized inputs:**
++- transmissionGearing (3 gears: 2.48, 1.48, 1.00)
++- frontalArea_ft2 (26.1 ft²)
++- tractionIndex (8)
++- stallRpm (3000)
++- All environment fields
++
++**Result:** Sim runs with **single-speed transmission** (gear=1, rpm=5000 constant) instead of 3-speed with shifts at 6000 RPM.
++
++**QuarterProTest1 Results:**
++- ❌ 123 mismatches
++- Similar pattern: missing transmission gearing, aero, PMI, environment
++
