++### 2. Physics Engine Fix - QuarterJr Shifting
++
++**Problem:** QuarterJr mode was reading `(vehicle as any).shiftRPM` expecting a scalar, but receiving an array `[6000, 6000, 6000]`, causing `Math.trunc()` to fail.
++
++**Fix:** Modified `src/domain/physics/models/vb6Exact.ts` lines 574-579:
++```typescript
++// Handle both scalar shiftRPM and array shiftRPM
++const rawShiftRPM = (vehicle as any).shiftRPM ?? drivetrain?.shiftRPM ?? 7000;
++const singleShiftRPM = Array.isArray(rawShiftRPM) 
++  ? Math.trunc(rawShiftRPM[0] ?? 7000)  // If array, use first value
++  : Math.trunc(rawShiftRPM);             // If scalar, use directly
++shiftRPMs = gearRatios.map(() => singleShiftRPM);
++```
++
++**Result:** ✅ **QuarterJrTest1 now shifts correctly**
