++  - Note: 594 and 1254 are skipped unless ShiftFlag=2 (post-shift)
++- **Bonneville Pro:** 7 track-specific configurations:
++  - Track 1: `[660, 1320, 1980, 2640, 3300, 3960, 4620, 5280]`
++  - Track 2: `[660, 1320, 2640, 3960, 5280, 5808, 6336, 6864]`
