++- **Quarter Jr/Pro:** 60 mph, 100 mph
++- **Bonneville Track 1:** 60 mph, 100 mph
++- **Bonneville Tracks 2-7:** 100 mph, 200 mph
++
++**Time Interval Selection (Lines 902-918):**
++- Formula: `z = ET / TimePrintInc + 2 * (NGR - 1)`, select smallest where `z < kd`
++- kd = 28 (Quarter Jr), 33 (Quarter Pro), 29 (Bonneville Pro)
++- Intervals: 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 35, 40, 50, 100 seconds
