++
++## Files Changed
++
++### 1. `src/integration-tests/helpers/vb6_equivalence_debug.ts` (~20 lines)
++- **Lines 202**: Added `DEBUG_HARNESS` flag
++- **Lines 206-226**: Fixed field name mapping
++  - Check both `dist_ft` and `distance_ft`
++  - Check both `accel` and `accel_g`
++  - Check both `time_s` and `time_et_s`
++  - Preserve `null` for rollout distance
++  - Added debug logging (gated by flag)
++
++### 2. `src/domain/physics/models/vb6Exact.ts` (~15 lines)
++- **Line 533**: Added `DEBUG_PRINT_TIMESLIP_ROWS` flag
++- **Lines 2224-2239**: Added raw timeslipRows debug output
++  - Print first 6 and last 6 rows
++  - Show all fields before harness processing
++  - Gated by debug flag
++
++**Total**: ~35 lines changed across 2 files
++
