++
++## Verification
++
++### Harness Mapping (After Fix):
++```
++[HARNESS MAP] [0] Staged:   dist_ft: undefined → 0      ✓
++[HARNESS MAP] [1] Rollout:  dist_ft: undefined → null   ✓ (null preserved!)
++[HARNESS MAP] [2] 21ft:     dist_ft: undefined → 21     ✓
++[HARNESS MAP] [3] 30ft:     dist_ft: undefined → 30     ✓
++[HARNESS MAP] [4] 50ft:     dist_ft: undefined → 50     ✓
++[HARNESS MAP] [5] 59ft:     dist_ft: undefined → 59     ✓
++```
++
++**Note**: Shows "undefined →" because `classic_sim_runner` already mapped `distance_ft` to `dist_ft`, so `row.distance_ft` is undefined in the harness. The fix checks `row.dist_ft` first.
++
