++
++## Confirmations
++
++✅ **rsaclassic NOT touched** - No edits to rsaclassic files
++✅ **Physics formulas NOT changed** - Only harness field mapping fixed
++✅ **No step size changes** - Integration unchanged
++✅ **No JSON fixture changes** - Test data unchanged
++✅ **Small, safe edits** - Only 35 lines across 2 files
