++
++The QuarterJrTest1 deltas are now **physics differences**, not harness bugs:
++- 25ft: +0.14s time, -4.7 mph
++- 30ft: +0.31s time, -3.4 mph
++- 60ft: +0.43s time, -4.9 mph
++
++These require physics formula comparison between VB6 and TypeScript, which is outside the scope of this harness integrity fix.
++
