++### Key Insight: Float32 Precision
++Float32 cannot represent most decimal values exactly:
++```
++160.85 as Float64: 160.850000000000000
++160.85 as Float32: 160.850006103515625 (NOT at tie point!)
++Displays as: 160.9 (rounds UP, not to even)
++```
