++### Corrected Method (RIGHT)
++```typescript
++// Use NEAREST BOUNDARY
++const {lo, hi} = getRawIntervalForDisplayedMPH(expectedDisplay);
++const mph_target_nearest = clampToInterval(mph_current, lo, hi);
++const dt_target = 45.0 / mph_target_nearest;
++const dt_error = dt_current - dt_target;
++```
