++- **Distance:** Exact value from printout (e.g., 11, 25, 39, ..., 660, 1320)
++- **Time:** 2 decimals from printout
++- **Acceleration:** Numeric value only (ignore "(s)" suffix if present), or `null` if not printed
++- **RPM:** Integer (remove commas, e.g., "8,500" → 8500)
++- **Rollout:** First line format "0.146/0.00" means `rollout_ft: 0.146`, `rollout_time_s: 0.00`
