++## ✅ Completed Infrastructure
++
++### 1. VB6 Numeric Semantics Layer
++**File:** `src/domain/physics/vb6/numericSemantics.ts` (300+ lines)
++
++Implements VB6's exact numeric type behaviors:
++
++**Type Coercion:**
++- `toSingle(value)` / `f32(value)` - VB6 Single (32-bit float) using `Math.fround()`
++- `toInteger(value)` - VB6 Integer (16-bit signed, -32768 to 32767)
++- `toLong(value)` - VB6 Long (32-bit signed)
++
++**VB6 Functions:**
++- `CInt(value)` - Round with banker's rounding, coerce to Integer
++- `CLng(value)` - Round with banker's rounding, coerce to Long
++- `Int(value)` - Round DOWN (toward negative infinity)
++- `Fix(value)` - Truncate toward zero
++- `Sgn(value)` - Sign function (-1, 0, 1)
++- `Round(value, decimals)` - Banker's rounding to decimal places
++
++**VB6 Operators:**
++- `vb6Divide(a, b)` - Division returning Single
++- `vb6IntDivide(a, b)` - Integer division (\)
++- `vb6Mod(a, b)` - Modulo operator
++- `vb6Power(base, exp)` - Exponentiation (^)
++
++**Helper Functions:**
++- `vb6Var(value, type)` - Document and enforce VB6 variable types
++- `vb6Compare(a, b, op)` - Floating point comparison with Single precision
++- `vb6Type(value, type, varName)` - Documentation helper (no-op at runtime)
++
++**Usage Example:**
++```typescript
++import { toSingle, CInt, Int, Fix, vb6Var } from './vb6/numericSemantics';
++
++// VB6: Dim rpm As Single
++const rpm = vb6Var(engineRPM, 'Single');
++
++// VB6: Dim gear As Integer
++const gear = vb6Var(currentGear, 'Integer');
++
++// VB6: ShiftRPM = CInt(6000.5)
++const shiftRPM = CInt(6000.5); // → 6000 (banker's rounding)
++
++// VB6: result = Int(-8.4)
++const result = Int(-8.4); // → -9 (floor)
++
++// VB6: result = Fix(-8.4)
++const result2 = Fix(-8.4); // → -8 (truncate)
++```
