++
++```json
++{ "time_s": 0.0,  "distance_ft": 0,  "mph": 0.0,  "accel": 2.48, "rpm": 7200 }  // Staged
++{ "time_abs_s": 0.131, "time_et_s": 0.0, "mph": 7.9, "accel": 2.69, "rpm": 7600 }  // Rollout
++{ "time_s": 0.5,  "distance_ft": 21, "mph": 37.4, "accel": 2.66, "rpm": 7600 }  // 21ft
++{ "time_s": 0.64, "distance_ft": 30, "mph": 45.9, "accel": 2.65, "rpm": 7600 }  // 30ft
++{ "time_s": 1.01, "distance_ft": 60, "mph": 64.9, "accel": 2.05, "rpm": 9200 }  // 60ft
++```
++
++### Pattern Analysis
++
++**time_s**:
++- Staged: 0.0 (1 decimal displayed as 0.0)
++- Rollout: 0.0 (matches VB6 "/0.00 Rollout")
++- 21ft: 0.5 (1 decimal, but VB6 prints 2 decimals → should be 0.50)
++- 30ft: 0.64 (2 decimals ✓)
++- 60ft: 1.01 (2 decimals ✓)
