++## Conclusion
++
++**JSON appears to match VB6 printed formatting** with one caveat:
++
++1. ✅ **mph**: 1 decimal (matches VB6)
++2. ✅ **accel**: 2 decimals (matches VB6)
++3. ✅ **rpm**: multiples of 10 (matches VB6)
++4. ✅ **distance_ft**: integers (matches VB6)
