++1. Recording rollout at t=0 (launch) instead of at rollout completion
++2. OR not capturing the state values at the right moment
++3. OR comparing against the wrong trace row
++
++**Fix:** Implement VB6-exact timeslip recorder that captures rollout at the moment `Dist >= rolloutFt` with current velocity and RPM values.
