++## Trigger Checking Order (Lines 1295-1352)
++
++VB6 checks triggers in this order each step:
++1. Distance triggers (iDist index through DistToPrint)
++2. Time triggers (TimePrint advancement)
++3. Speed triggers (iMPH index through MPHtoPrint)
++4. Gear shift triggers (ShiftFlag state machine)
++
++**Velocity Revision Priority** (Lines 1295-1310):
++When multiple triggers fire in same step, VB6 selects the one with smallest velocity (earliest event):
++```vb6
++NextVel = Vel(L)
++If VelDistMatch > 0 And VelDistMatch < NextVel Then NextVel = VelDistMatch
++If VelTimeMatch > 0 And VelTimeMatch < NextVel Then NextVel = VelTimeMatch
++If VelMPHMatch > 0 And VelMPHMatch < NextVel Then NextVel = VelMPHMatch
++If VelShiftMatch > 0 And VelShiftMatch < NextVel Then NextVel = VelShiftMatch
++```
++
++## Interpolation Methods
++
++### sub310 - Distance Interpolation (Lines 1609-1640)
++```vb6
++' Solve for factor to reach exact distance
++factor = (DistToPrint(iDist) - Dist0) / (ASV(2) - Dist0)
++' Linear interpolation for time/vel
++time(L) = Time0 + factor * (ASV(1) - Time0)
++Dist(L) = DistToPrint(iDist)  ' Exact distance
++Vel(L) = Vel0 + factor * (ASV(3) - Vel0)
++' Call sub325 for AGS/RPM
++```
++
++### sub315 - Time Interpolation (Lines 1642-1647)
++```vb6
++' Solve for factor to reach exact time
++factor = (TimePrint - Time0) / (ASV(1) - Time0)
++' Linear interpolation for dist/vel
++time(L) = TimePrint  ' Exact time
++Dist(L) = Dist0 + factor * (ASV(2) - Dist0)
++Vel(L) = Vel0 + factor * (ASV(3) - Vel0)
++' Call sub325 for AGS/RPM
++```
++
++### sub325 - Common AGS/RPM Interpolation (Lines 1658-1681)
++```vb6
++' Non-linear factor for AGS/RPM
++factor = factor ^ 0.7
++AGS(L) = Ags0 + factor * (ASV(4) - Ags0)
++EngRPM(L) = RPM0 + factor * (ASV(6) - RPM0)
++' Conditional emission based on iDist/ShiftFlag
++If (iDist <> 5 And iDist <> 8) Or ShiftFlag = 2 Then AddListLine
++```
++
++## Gear Shift Logic (Lines 1328-1342, 1440-1459)
++
++Two rows per shift:
++1. **Pre-shift row**: Old gear at shift RPM (before ratio change)
++2. **Post-shift row**: New gear at reduced RPM (after ratio change)
++
++```vb6
++' Lines 1328-1342: Detect shift
++If Gear <> GearOld And ShiftFlag = 0 Then
++    ShiftFlag = 1  ' Pre-shift pending
++    ' ... emit pre-shift row
++End If
++
++' Lines 1440-1459: Post-shift
++If ShiftFlag = 2 Then
++    ' ... emit post-shift row
++    ShiftFlag = 0
++End If
++```
++
++## Rollout Logic (Lines 1373-1381)
++
++```vb6
++' ET reset at rollout
++time(L) = 0
++' Overhang adjustment
++Dist(L) = Dist(L) + ovradj
++' Increase tolerance
++DistTol = 0.1
++```
++
++## Formatting (Lines 1481-1519)
++
++VB6 applies formatting at print time only:
++- Time: 2 decimals (Format$(time(L), "0.00"))
++- Distance: Integer feet (Format$(Dist(L), "0"))
++- MPH: 1 decimal (Format$(Vel(L) * 1.4667, "0.0"))
++- Accel: 2 decimals (Format$(AGS(L), "0.00"))
++- RPM: Nearest 10 (Format$(Int(EngRPM(L) / 10 + 0.5) * 10, "0"))
++- Gear: Integer (Format$(Gear, "0"))
