++## Section C: Type & Conversion Map Table
++
++### VB6 Operator Type Rules (Critical)
++
++1. **Const without suffix** → Double
++2. **Dim As Single** → Single
++3. **Expression with Double operand** → Result is Double
++4. **Assignment to Single variable** → Truncates Double result to Single
++
++### Line-by-Line Analysis
++
++| VB6 Line | VB6 Code | Operand Types | Expression Type | Assignment Target | Truncation Point | TS Current | MISMATCH? | Fix |
++|----------|----------|---------------|-----------------|-------------------|------------------|------------|-----------|-----|
++| 1010 | `TABY(..., HP)` | Single arrays, Single out | Single | HP (Single) | At TABY return | Uses M.* (f32 each op) | **Y** | Compute in f64, truncate on return |
++| 1011 | `HP = HPTQMult * HP / hpc` | Double(CValue) * Single / Single | Double | HP (Single) | On assignment | M.div(M.mul(f(),f()),f()) | **Y** | Compute in f64, assign via `asSingle()` |
++| 1013 | `TQ = Z6 * HP / EngRPM(L)` | Double * Single / Single | Double | TQ (Single) | On assignment | M.div(M.mul(f(Z6),...)) | **Y** | Z6 is Double; compute in f64, truncate on assign |
++| 1014 | `TQ = TQ * TorqueMult * TGR * TGEff` | Single * Double * Single * Single | Double | TQ (Single) | On assignment | M.mul chain with f() | **Y** | Compute in f64, truncate on assign |
++| 1017 | `q = Sgn(WindFPS) * rho * Abs(WindFPS)^2 / (2*gc)` | Single * Single * Single / Double | Double | q (Single) | On assignment | M.* chain | **Y** | gc is Double; compute in f64, truncate |
++| 1019 | `DragForce = CMU * Weight + DragCoef * RefArea * q` | Double * Double + Double * Double * Single | Double | DragForce (Single) | On assignment | M.add(M.mul...) | **Y** | CMU is Double; compute in f64, truncate |
++| 1020 | `force = TQ * GR * Eff / (TireSlip * TireDia / 24) - DragForce` | Single * Double * Double / (Single * Single / Double) - Single | Double | force (Single) | On assignment | M.sub(M.div...) | **Y** | Compute in f64, truncate |
++| 1024 | `Ags0 = 0.96 * force / Weight` | Double * Single / Double | Double | Ags0 (Single) | On assignment | M.div(M.mul(f(0.96)...)) | **Y** | 0.96 is Double literal; compute in f64, truncate |
++| 1050 | `CAXI = (1 - (TI-1)*0.01) / (TTE^0.25)` | Double literals, Single vars | Double | CAXI (Single) | On assignment | M.div(M.sub...) | **Y** | Compute in f64, truncate |
++| 1051 | `CRTF = CAXI * AX * TireDia * (Width+1) * (...)` | Single * Double * Single * ... | Double | CRTF (Single) | On assignment | M.mul chain | **Y** | AX is Double; compute in f64, truncate |
++| 1054 | `AMAX = (CRTF - DragForce) / Weight` | (Single - Single) / Double | Double | AMAX (Single) | On assignment | M.div(M.sub...) | **Y** | Weight is Double (CValue); compute in f64, truncate |
++| 872 | `TireSlip = 1.02 + (TI-1)*0.005 + (TTE-1)*3` | Double literals | Double | TireSlip (Single) | On assignment | M.add chain with f() | **Y** | Compute in f64, truncate |
++
++### Key Insight
++
++**VB6 computes ALL these expressions in Double precision, then truncates to Single ONLY at the assignment.**
++
++**TS currently truncates at EVERY intermediate operation via `M.mul`, `M.div`, etc. which apply `Math.fround` after each step.**
++
++This is the fundamental mismatch.
++
