++# TABY + ENGINE Curve Line-by-Line Parity Audit
++
++## Overview
++
++This document audits the HP lookup and engine curve path feeding INIT:
++- VB6: `TABY` (RSALIB.BAS:531-573), `BISC` (RSALIB.BAS:12-62), `ENGINE` (TIMESLIP.FRM:1758-1828)
++- TS: `TABY` (vb6SimulationStep.ts:240-261), `taby`/`bisc` (dtaby.ts), `buildEngineCurve` (engineCurve.ts)
