++## VB6 Coercion Rules Applied
++
++1. **TABY computation is in Double precision**
++   - `P` has no type suffix → Variant → promoted to Double in arithmetic
++   - `xtabj`, `xtabi` have no suffix → Variant → Double
++   - Expression `P * (XVAL - xtabi) / (xtabj - xtabi)` computed in Double
++
++2. **Assignment truncates to Single**
++   - `YVAL = YVAL + P` → YVAL is Single, so result truncated
++   - But `YVAL` accumulates in the loop, so truncation happens per iteration
++
++3. **Array indexing is 1-based in VB6**
++   - `XTAB(1)` is first element, `XTAB(N%)` is last
++   - TS uses 0-based: `XTAB[0]` is first, `XTAB[N-1]` is last
++
++4. **ENGINE curve generation**
++   - `TQPHP`, `TQ`, `TQR`, `HPCID` are all Single
++   - Assignments like `TQ = TQR * TQPHP` truncate to Single
++   - `yhp(N) = xrpm(N) * TQ / Z6` → computed in Double (Z6 is Double), truncated to Single
++
