++A regression guard test prevents reintroduction of per-op truncation:
++
++**File:** `src/domain/physics/vb6/__tests__/no_perop_truncation_guard.spec.ts`
++
++**Enforces:**
++- No `M.add`, `M.sub`, `M.mul`, `M.div`, `M.sqrt`, `M.pow`, `M.abs` in production code
++- No standalone `f(` calls in production code
++- Strips comments/strings to avoid false positives
++
