++# VB6 ↔ TypeScript Crosswalk
++
++> **⚠️ DEPRECATED PATTERNS IN THIS DOCUMENT**
++> 
++> This document was written before the VB6 semantics refactoring. References to `M.*` 
++> and `f()` patterns are **OUTDATED**. These per-operation truncation helpers have been
++> **REMOVED** from production code.
++> 
++> **Current architecture:** See `docs/audit/vb6_truncation_architecture.md`
++> - Compute in Double (JavaScript default)
++> - Truncate to Single ONLY at assignment via `vb6AssignSingle()`
++> - No per-op truncation (M.*/f() removed)
++
++This document maps VB6 TIMESLIP.FRM procedures to their TypeScript equivalents for line-by-line parity verification.
++
++---
++
++## 1. Init / Staged Calculation
++
++### VB6 Source
++- **File:** `TIMESLIP.FRM`
++- **Procedure:** Main simulation init
++- **Lines:** 1003-1057
++
++| VB6 Line | Description | VB6 Code |
++|----------|-------------|----------|
++| 1003 | Init state | `L = 1: Time0 = 0: time(L) = 0: Vel(L) = 0: Dist(L) = 0: DSRPM = 0` |
++| 1010-1014 | HP/Torque calc | `Call TABY(...): HP = HPTQMult * HP / hpc: TQ = Z6 * HP / EngRPM(L): TQ = TQ * TorqueMult * TGR(iGear) * TGEff(iGear)` |
++| 1016-1019 | Drag force | `WindFPS = ...: q = ...: DragForce = CMU * Weight + DragCoef * RefArea * q` |
++| 1020 | Wheel force | `force = TQ * GearRatio * Efficiency / (TireSlip * TireDia / 24) - DragForce` |
++| 1023-1027 | Initial accel | `If gc_TransType.Value Then Ags0 = 0.96 * force / Weight Else Ags0 = 0.88 * force / Weight` |
++| 1046-1054 | AMAX calc | `StaticRWT = ...: CAXI = ...: CRTF = ...: AMAX = (CRTF - DragForce) / Weight` |
++| 1055-1056 | Clamp Ags0 | `If Ags0 > AMAX Then Ags0 = AMAX: SLIP(L) = 1` |
