++| 1740-1746 | HP/Torque calc | `HP_launch`, `HP_corrected`, `TQ` |
++| 1752-1755 | Drag force | `cmu_launch`, `WindFPS_launch`, `q_launch`, `DragForce_launch` |
++| 1772 | Wheel force | `force` |
++| 1778-1779 | Initial accel | `lossFactor`, `Ags0_g` |
