++### Numeric Type Behavior
++
++| Variable | VB6 Type | TS Handling | Truncation Point |
++|----------|----------|-------------|------------------|
++| HP_launch | Single | `f()` via TABY | After TABY lookup |
++| HP_corrected | Single | `M.div(M.mul(...))` | Each operation |
++| TQ | Single | `M.mul(...)` chain | Each operation |
++| force | Single | `M.sub(M.div(...))` | Each operation |
++| Ags0_g | Single | `M.div(M.mul(...))` | Each operation |
++| CAXI | Single | `calcCAXI()` | Inside function |
++| CRTF | Single | `M.mul(...)` chain | Each operation |
++| AMax | Single | `M.div(M.sub(...))` | Each operation |
++
++**Critical:** VB6 `Single` is 32-bit float. TS uses `Math.fround()` via `f()` helper.
