++## 2. Rollout Detection
++
++### VB6 Source
++- **File:** `TIMESLIP.FRM`
++- **Lines:** 1373-1381
++
++| VB6 Line | Description | VB6 Code |
++|----------|-------------|----------|
++| 997 | DistTol before rollout | `DistTol = 0.005` |
++| 1373-1377 | Rollout check | `If DistStep < DistTol And (DistStep / Vel(L)) < TimeTol Then ...` |
++| 1379 | DistTol after rollout | `DistTol = 0.1` |
++| 1380 | Timer reset | `If gc_Rollout.Value > 0 Then time(L) = 0` |
++| 1381 | Overhang adjust | `Dist(L) = Dist(L) + ovradj` |
++
++### TypeScript Equivalent
++- **File:** `src/domain/physics/models/vb6Exact.ts`
++- **Lines:** 1660-1706
++
++| TS Line | Description |
++|---------|-------------|
++| 1660-1661 | Tolerances: `DistTol = 0.005`, `TimeTol = 0.002` |
++| 1664 | Rollout check: `if (DistStep < DistTol && (DistStep / state.Vel_ftps) < TimeTol)` |
++| 1667 | Timer start: `timerStartTime_s = state.time_s` |
++| 1701-1702 | Overhang adjust: `state.Dist_ft = state.Dist_ft + ovradj` |
++
++### Numeric Type Behavior
++
++| Variable | VB6 Type | TS Handling |
