++| **Conditional HP/TQ formatting** | `ECommon/ENGINE.FRM:2030–2039` (`LoadScreen`) | — | ❌ | `≥100: Formatted`, `≥10: ###.0`, `<10: ##.00`. TS always uses integer. |
++| **Force IR for 1-cyl** | `ECommon/ENGINE.FRM:1519–1522, 1214–1217` | — | ❌ | VB6 forces `manifold=2` when `noCyl=1`. |
++| **Force inline for odd cyl** | `ECommon/ENGINE.FRM:1509–1516` | — | ❌ | VB6 forces `inline=0` for odd cylinder counts. |
++| **Round cam duration to even** | `ECommon/ENGINE.FRM:1966` | — | ❌ | VB6 `Round(val, 2)` rounds to nearest even number. |
++| **Rod length vs stroke check** | `ECommon/ENGINE.FRM:1605–1618` | — | ❌ | VB6 shows MsgBox if `rod < 1.25*stroke`. |
