++### Analysis of Failures
++
++All 5 failures are **rounding boundary cases**:
++- Differences: 0.005-0.010s (0.1-0.2% of total ET)
++- All cases: our simulation is slightly slower than VB6
++- Pattern: raw ET lands just above the 0.005s rounding boundary
++
