++- Rollout row has dual-time format: `time_abs_s` (absolute) and `time_et_s` (ET clock = 0.00)
++- All checkpoints after rollout use ET clock (`time_et_s`)
++- Checkpoint ET at 660/1320 ft matches summary ET exactly (0.0 ms delta)
