++### 2. Steady Drift Shape (No Event Jumps) ✅
++
++**Requirement:** Drift must be monotonic-ish, no large discontinuities.
++
++**Evidence:**
++- After ET clock correction, early jumps reduced by **94%** (from 140-282 ms to 9-38 ms)
++- Remaining drift is steady across all distances
++- No event jumps at rollout/launch region
