++ * Intercepts process.stdout.write during simulation to suppress ALL stdout noise.
++ * Collects trace lines via sink, then outputs pure JSONL after simulation.
++ * 
++ * FIXTURE SOURCE: src/integration-tests/fixtures/json/QuarterJrTest1.json
++ * All inputs below are derived from that fixture - DO NOT GUESS OR INVENT VALUES.
++ * 
++ * Usage:
++ *   npx vite-node scripts/capture-init-trace.ts > scripts/traces/quarterjr-ts-init.jsonl
++ * 
++ * Output: 37 lines of pure JSONL (17 INPUT_* + 20 INIT steps)
