++# Dev Portal Audit
++
++> Generated 2026-02-12. Covers all panels in `src/dev/panels/` and `src/dev/registry.tsx`.
++
++## 1. Panel Inventory
++
++| # | id | title | category | what it does | visibility | risk | notes |
++|---|-----|-------|----------|-------------|-----------|------|-------|
++| 1 | `settings` | ⚙️ Settings & Flags | core | User level (program tier) selector, feature flags (vb6Strict, diagnostics, etc.), VB6 rounding settings, console log viewer | devOnly | safe | User Level section overlaps with View As; consider removing tier selector |
++| 2 | `health-check` | 🩺 Health Check | core | Validate VB6 fixture, dry-run normalization, smoke sim (1320 ft) | devOnly | safe | Read-only + runs sim. No mutations. |
++| 3 | `run-inspector` | ▶️ Run Inspector | simulation | Run sims with VB6 fixtures, inspect step-by-step physics data, vehicle picker | devOnly | safe | Core dev tool. No mutations. |
++| 4 | `energy` | ⚡ Energy Accounting | simulation | Visualize energy flow/balance during sim runs | devOnly | safe | Read-only analysis. |
++| 5 | `input-inspector` | 🔍 Input Inspector | data | Visualize/compare VB6 fixtures and sim inputs, diff against benchmarks | devOnly | safe | Read-only. |
++| 6 | `quick-paste` | 📋 Quick Paste | data | Paste dyno tables + PMI values into VB6 fixtures, save/load profiles | devOnly | safe | Writes to fixture store + localStorage profiles. Low risk. |
++| 7 | `air` | 🌡️ Air Model | data | Air density calculator, dynamic pressure at various speeds | devOnly | safe | Read-only analysis. |
++| 8 | `parity` | 🧪 Parity Runner | testing | Run benchmark tests, compare VB6Exact against targets | devOnly | safe | Read-only validation. |
++| 9 | `users` | 👥 User Management | core | CRUD users (API), roles (localStorage), products (localStorage). Has "Reset All Auth Data" button. | ownerOnly | **destructive** | Reset button wipes all auth localStorage + reloads. Should be gated + confirmed. |
++| 10 | `plans` | 🔑 Plans & Capabilities | core | Read-only display of current user's plan/role/trial, all plans with caps, all roles | devTools | safe | Uses new namespaced capability model. No overlap with UserManagement. |
++| 11 | `view-as` | 👁️ View As | core | Override capability context to simulate any plan/role/trial | devTools | safe | Writes to localStorage override key. Self-contained. |
++| 12 | `tracks` | 🏁 Track Editor | data | CRUD drag racing tracks (API). Admin/owner gated internally. | devTools | safe | Writes to API. Has its own role check. |
++
++## 2. Overlap & Duplication Analysis
++
++| Area | Panels involved | Overlap | Recommendation |
++|------|----------------|---------|----------------|
++| **User tier/level** | `settings` (User Level selector) vs `view-as` (plan/role override) | Settings has a legacy "User Level" selector (quarterJr/quarterPro/admin) that predates the capability model. View As supersedes it for access testing. | **KEEP both** — Settings User Level controls input visibility (which fields show), View As controls capability/access gating. Different concerns. |
++| **Plans/Caps display** | `plans` vs `users` (Roles/Products tabs) | Plans shows the new capability model (PlanId→caps). Users shows legacy Role→Product→Feature model. Both are needed during migration. | **KEEP both** — Plans is the canonical capability inspector. Users is the admin CRUD tool for the legacy auth system. |
++| **Destructive actions** | `users` has "Reset All Auth Data" inline in debug info | Unguarded destructive action sitting at the top of a management panel. | **MOVE to Danger Zone** with typed confirmation. |
++
++## 3. Risk Assessment
++
++### Destructive Actions Found
++
++| Panel | Action | What it does | Current gating | Recommendation |
++|-------|--------|-------------|----------------|----------------|
++| `users` | "Reset All Auth Data" button | Calls `auth.resetAuthData()` → wipes localStorage keys (currentUser, users, roles, products) → reloads page | None (visible to anyone who can see the panel) | Move to dedicated Danger Zone panel. Require typed confirmation ("RESET AUTH DATA"). |
++| `users` | Delete User | Calls `usersApi.delete(id)` | Only shown in edit modal | Acceptable — modal is sufficient confirmation. |
++| `tracks` | Delete Track | Calls `deleteTrackFromAPI(id)` | Admin/owner check in component | Acceptable — has role check. |
++
++### Visibility Gaps
++
++| Issue | Details | Fix |
++|-------|---------|-----|
++| No per-panel visibility enforcement | All panels shown to anyone who reaches `/dev`. Route is gated to owner/admin, but no per-panel filtering. | Add `visibility` metadata to registry + filter in DevPortal.tsx. |
++| UserManagement has no capability check | Relies on route-level gating only. Should require `ownerOnly` for destructive operations. | Add `visibility: 'ownerOnly'` to registry entry. |
++| TrackEditor has internal role check | Good — but inconsistent with other panels that don't check. | Standardize via registry metadata. |
