++---
++
++## A) Product North Star
++
++**Target Users:** Drag racers (bracket, index, heads-up) who need accurate ET/MPH predictions, vehicle tuning, and race-day tools. Secondary audience: engine builders and suspension tuners.
++
++**Core Workflows:**
++1. **Build a vehicle** — enter specs (weight, power, gearing, tire, weather) → save
++2. **Predict performance** — run ET Sim → get predicted ET, MPH, incremental data
++3. **Race day** — live weather corrections, dial-in calculator, opponent tracking, ladder brackets
++4. **Log & learn** — record actual runs, compare to predictions, adaptive learning improves accuracy
++5. **Engine simulation** — model engine performance curves, dyno-style output
++6. **Component libraries** — save/share engines, clutches, four-link setups
++
++**What "Success" Means:**
++- Predictions within 0.01s of VB6-era RSA accuracy (parity target)
++- Free tier drives sign-ups; Basic ($9.99/mo) converts 5%+ of active free users
++- Sub-second page loads, full offline capability for race-day use
++- Zero access-control bugs: free users never see paid content, paid users never hit false blocks
++
++---
++
++## B) Tier Contract
++
++### Free (no subscription)
++- **Calculators:** Weather correction, dyno HP, gear ratio, weight-to-power
++- **Vehicle editor:** 1 vehicle, basic fields only
++- **Simulation:** Basic ET/MPH calculator (`sim.basic`) — no incremental data, no learning
++- **Engine Sim:** Full access (simple mode — tier controls advanced features)
++- **Libraries:** Browse and save components (engines, clutches, four-links)
++- **No access to:** ET Sim, Race Tools, Run Logging, Vehicle Management page
++- **Limits:** 1 vehicle, 10 saved runs
++
++### Basic / Racer ($9.99/mo)
++- Everything Free has, plus:
++- **ET Sim:** Full predict with incremental data and run completion
++- **Race Tools:** Race Day dashboard, Dial-In, Opponents, Ladder, Tech Card, Import
++- **Run Logging:** Log runs, view history, compare to predictions
++- **Vehicles:** Save up to 5 vehicles, full Quarter Jr field set
++- **Learning:** Adaptive corrections from logged runs
++- **Limits:** 5 vehicles, 100 saved runs
++
++### Pro ($24.99/mo)
++- Everything Basic has, plus:
++- **Advanced Sim:** Full incremental data, advanced settings, HP curve editor
++- **Clutch Sim / Converter Sim** (Quarter Pro features)
++- **Engine Pro:** VB6-accurate engine performance simulation
++- **Suspension Sim** (Four Link product)
++- **Vehicle editor:** Unlimited vehicles, Quarter Pro fields, throttle stop
++- **Data:** CSV export, data import, advanced charts
++- **Libraries:** Install shared components from library
++- **Limits:** Unlimited vehicles, 1000 saved runs
++
++### Team ($49.99/mo)
++- Everything Pro has, plus:
++- **Team Management:** Add/remove members, shared vehicles, shared runs
++- **Limits:** 5 team seats (included), unlimited vehicles and runs
++
++### Special Tiers
++- **Beta:** Full Pro access during beta period + dev tools
++- **Owner:** Full access to everything including admin panels
++
