++## D) Architecture Snapshot
++
++### Authentication
++- **Clerk** (`ClerkAuthProvider.tsx`) — primary auth provider, SSO/social login
++- **Legacy auth** (`authStore.tsx`) — role→product→feature mapping, `useAuth()` hook
++- **Three parallel access systems** that must stay in sync:
++  1. `useAuth() → hasFeature/hasProduct` (legacy feature flags)
++  2. `useCapabilities() → hasCap()` (new capability system, plan-based)
++  3. `useSubscription() → tier/features` (subscription tier features)
++
++### Tiers & Capabilities
++- **Plans** (`capabilities.ts`): free, basic, pro, team → capability sets
++- **Tiers** (`entitlements.ts`): free, racer, pro, team, beta, owner → feature booleans + limits
++- **Guards** (`guards.ts`): 4 centralized gates (ET Sim, Race Tools, Run Logging, Vehicles)
++- **View As** (`devViewAs.ts`, `viewAsStore.ts`): Dev override that wires into all 3 systems
++
++### Storage
++- **Local:** `localStorage` for vehicles, runs, preferences, View As overrides
++- **Remote:** Clerk user metadata, no dedicated backend DB yet
++- **State management:** React context providers (`VehicleProvider`, `RunHistoryProvider`, `PreferencesProvider`)
++- **Asset stores:** `engineAssets.ts`, `clutchAssets.ts`, `fourLinkAssets.ts` — localStorage-backed
++
++### PWA / Offline
++- Not yet implemented
++- Target: race-day pages should work offline with cached weather data
++
++### Simulations
++- **VB6 Exact** (`vb6Exact.ts`): Port of legacy VB6 RSA physics — primary simulation engine
++- **Quarter Jr / Quarter Pro**: Drag strip ET/MPH prediction (1/8, 1/4 mile)
++- **Bonneville Pro**: Land speed simulation
++- **Engine Sim** (`EngineSimDashboard.tsx`): Engine performance curves, dyno output
++- **Clutch Sim / Converter Sim**: Drivetrain simulation (Pro feature)
++- **Suspension Sim**: Four-link geometry (Four Link product)
++- **Parity testing**: VB6 equivalence tests compare JS output to original VB6 fixtures
++
++### Libraries
++- **Engine Library** (`EnginesLibrary.tsx`): Save/load engine configurations
++- **Clutch Library** (`ClutchesLibrary.tsx`): Save/load clutch setups
++- **Four Link Library** (`FourLinksLibrary.tsx`): Save/load suspension geometry
++- Install capability is Pro+ only; save is available to all logged-in users
++
