++## Dynamic Limit Notes
++
++1. **Stroke limits**: bore/2.1 ≤ stroke ≤ bore/0.6 (B/S ratio), AND rod/4 ≤ stroke ≤ rod/1.25 (R/S ratio). Tightest wins.
++2. **Rod limits**: stroke×1.25 ≤ rod ≤ min(stroke×3.6, 11.5")
++3. **CarbCFM limits**: computed from `SetCarbCFM()` using bore, stroke, noCyl, Gulp, max RPM at 6150 fpm piston speed
++4. **NoInValves max**: Overhead Cam → 3, Roller → 2, all others → 1
++5. **ValveDia limits**: sqrt(0.16×bore²/niv) ≤ vd ≤ sqrt(0.32×bore²/niv) [or 0.36 for multi-valve]
++6. **MaxInFlow limits**: computed from valve area × flow flux min/max
++7. **RefBore limits**: bore×0.95 ≤ refBore ≤ bore×1.05
