++ * 
++ * VB6 Source: TIMESLIP.FRM lines 1074-1075 (ChassisPMI), line 1107 (Velocity)
++ * 
++ * VB6 Variable Types:
++ *   ChassisPMI         - Single (line 507)
++ *   gc_TiresPMI.Value  - Variant→Double (CValue)
++ *   gc_TransPMI.Value  - Variant→Double (CValue)
++ *   gc_GearRatio.Value - Variant→Double (CValue)
