++ *   TimeStep           - Single (line 526)
++ *   Jerk               - Single (line 513)
++ * 
++ * VB6 Coercion Rules:
++ *   1. CValue controls return Variant→Double
++ *   2. gc is a Double constant (32.174)
++ *   3. Expressions with Double operands compute in Double
++ *   4. Truncation to Single occurs ONLY at assignment
