++ * BLOCK 3: Velocity Targeting Sqr Formula (line 1135)
++ *   Vel(L) = Sqr(Vel0 ^ 2 + 2 * Ags0 * gc * (DistToPrint(iDist) - Dist0))
++ * 
++ * VB6 Variable Types (from TIMESLIP.FRM Dim statements):
++ *   Vel(L), Vel0      - Single (lines 536, 522)
