++/**
++ * Display parity tests for VB6-consistent formatting.
++ *
++ * Tests vb6Round (banker's rounding) and vb6Fixed against known VB6 behavior,
++ * plus domain-specific formatters for Flow Bench, Flow Details, and Mech Details.
++ *
++ * VB6 source references:
++ *   - Cvalue.CLS lines 419-423: Formatted = Format(Round(Value, 10^-DecimalPlaces), ValFmt)
++ *   - VB6 Round() uses banker's rounding (round-half-to-even)
++ *   - ENGPERF.BAS SetAllValues: DecimalPlaces per gc_ control
++ *   - CDETAILS.CLS: RightAlign(maxlen, decimals, value) for table columns
++ */
